Hide an error and report an empty successful state.

•
Remove a security control merely to make a test pass.

•
Use Firebase rules as a substitute for Supabase RLS.

•
Claim malware scanning if no malware scanner exists.

2.4 Work in complete batches

Do not ask for approval for every individual file. Work through the complete mission in coherent stages. Stop only for a genuine safety blocker, missing baseline, ambiguous destructive operation, or production authorization requirement.




